---
import { GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL } from "../../lib/site";
---
<!-- ── Final CTA ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section id="download" class="sec-cta">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <h2 class="display cta-title">Run T3 Trade on testnet.</h2>
    <p class="cta-sub">
      Install a supported agent CLI, add a testnet-only signer key, pick a perp, and type your
      mandate.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a id="cta-download-btn" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://github.com/TaraxioT/t3trade/releases">
        Download for macOS
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
    </div>
    <p class="cta-release" id="hero-release" hidden>
      <span id="hero-release-tag"></span> · macOS arm64, not notarized
    </p>

    <p class="cta-install-label">or install it in one line</p>
    <pre class="cta-install"><code>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TaraxioT/t3trade/main/scripts/install-macos.sh | bash</code></pre>

    <p class="cta-note">
      The macOS build is Apple Silicon only and is not notarized, so a downloaded copy is
      quarantined and macOS may refuse to open it. The installer above fetches the same DMG
      and clears that flag. To do it by hand, drag the app to Applications and run:
    </p>
    <pre class="cta-install cta-install--sm"><code>xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine "/Applications/T3 Trade (Alpha).app"</code></pre>
    <p class="cta-note">
      Older builds and checksums are on the <a href="https://github.com/TaraxioT/t3trade/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">releases page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* ── Final CTA ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .sec-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 130px 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sec-cta::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 -50% 0;
    height: 60%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, var(--accent-dim) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .cta-inner { position: relative; }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.6vw, 66px);
  }

  .cta-sub {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 18px;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 20px auto 34px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-release {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .cta-release span { color: var(--fg-muted); }

  .cta-install-label {
    margin: 26px 0 8px;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* The command has to survive a phone without wrapping into nonsense, so it
     scrolls inside its own box rather than breaking mid-URL. */
  .cta-install {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 640px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .cta-install code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .cta-install--sm {
    margin-top: 14px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .cta-note {
    margin: 26px auto 0;
    max-width: 560px;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-note a {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(161, 161, 170, 0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .cta-note a:hover {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration-color: var(--fg);
  }

  /* ── Responsive ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .sec-cta {
      padding: 96px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
